{"turn_id": "d10-t1", "session_id": "d10", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "entity_identification_then_typing", "text": "在标注过程中，首先需要识别数据集中出现的实体，然后用13种可能的类型之一对其进行标注。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"}]}, {"key": "type_descriptions_available", "text": "论文为每种实体类型提供了描述，并将这些描述同时提供给标注者和挑战赛参与者。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"}]}, {"key": "hashtag_mention_protocol", "text": "由于@提及用于指称人物、#话题标签用于标示关键词，标注过程对它们采用了专门的处理协议：只有当两个条件都满足时，话题标签或提及才应被标注为实体。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"}]}, {"key": "thirteen_entity_types", "text": "挑战赛要求识别13种实体类型：person、musicartist、organisation、geoloc、product、transportLine、media、sportsteam、event、tvshow、movie、facility、other。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-2da092855580ca68f6de58a1"}]}, {"key": "no_hierarchical_entities", "text": "实体不允许层级化，即连续词作为一个整体属于一个实体，每个词只关联一种实体类型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-2da092855580ca68f6de58a1"}]}, {"key": "inter_annotator_agreement", "text": "标注者间一致性基于Cohen's Kappa在训练集前200条推文上计算，得分为0.70，被认为表示强一致性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d10-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d10-t2", "session_id": "d10", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "annotation_two_steps", "text": "标注流程要求先识别数据集中出现的实体，再用13种可能类型之一对其进行标注。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"}]}, {"key": "entity_type_table", "text": "论文为每一种实体类型提供了说明，既提供给标注者也提供给挑战赛参与者。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"}]}, {"key": "mention_hashtag_function", "text": "论文指出，提及（以@开头的字符串）和话题标签（以#开头的字符串）在推文中具有特殊作用：前者用于指称人物，后者用于指示关键词。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"}]}, {"key": "hashtag_mention_protocol", "text": "标注协议规定，话题标签或提及要被标注为实体，必须同时满足两个条件。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"}]}, {"key": "cohen_kappa_measure", "text": "标注者之间的一致性基于Cohen's Kappa衡量，计算对象是训练集的前200条推文。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"}]}, {"key": "kappa_score", "text": "Cohen's Kappa得分为0.70，据作者所引文献，该分数表示高度一致（strong agreement）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-78f3bd1d48efb38bcc8ce848"}]}, {"key": "thirteen_types_list", "text": "挑战赛要求识别13种实体类型：person、musicartist、organisation、geoloc、product、transportLine、media、sportsteam、event、tvshow、movie、facility、other。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-2da092855580ca68f6de58a1"}]}, {"key": "boundaries_then_type", "text": "NER任务被描述为需要先识别实体的边界，然后预测实体类型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-2da092855580ca68f6de58a1"}]}, {"key": "no_hierarchical_entities", "text": "论文规定实体不允许层级化：连续词整体属于一个实体，每个词只关联单一实体类型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-2da092855580ca68f6de58a1"}]}, {"key": "non_entity_tweets", "text": "论文指出部分推文可能不含实体，因此系统不应偏向于为每条推文预测一个或多个实体。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-2da092855580ca68f6de58a1"}]}, {"key": "annotators_background", "text": "标注者为法语母语者，并且此前具有NER任务经验。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-69a9a888db97860c135c9515"}]}, {"key": "dataset_scope", "text": "该数据集整体包含6,685条标注推文，包含13种实体类型，并以CoNLL格式和BIO编码发布。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1707.07568", "chunk_id": "c-5242cae8f8974ce6c63683b8"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d10-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
